  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "c01-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "什么时候该让多个 AI Agent 并行工作？答案先看任务能不能拆开。",
      "gapBefore": 0,
      "audioDuration": 5.232,
      "audioStart": 0,
      "spokenStart": 0.164,
      "spokenEnd": 4.584,
      "actualGapBefore": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Anthropic 在多 Agent 研究系统复盘中给出一个清楚边界：并行能扩大搜索广度，但只有独立路径、高价值结果和足够工具空间同时存在时，协调成本才值得。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 11.544,
      "audioStart": 4.581,
      "spokenStart": 4.744,
      "spokenEnd": 15.483,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "它的内部研究评测里，Opus 4 主 Agent 配合 Sonnet 4 子 Agent，比单个 Opus 4 高出百分之九十点二。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.2,
      "audioStart": 15.49,
      "spokenStart": 15.643,
      "spokenEnd": 22.048,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "这个数字来自特定内部评测，不代表所有任务都会得到同样提升。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.04,
      "audioStart": 21.987,
      "spokenStart": 22.148,
      "spokenEnd": 26.395,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "这期我们做一张单 Agent 和多 Agent 决策树。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.6,
      "audioStart": 26.391,
      "spokenStart": 26.555,
      "spokenEnd": 29.349,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "先判断适配度，再写委派契约、分配搜索力度、检查证据，最后给并行系统加上恢复能力。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.008,
      "audioStart": 29.287,
      "spokenStart": 29.449,
      "spokenEnd": 35.65,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "视频全程干货高价值，让你成为更擅长使用 AI 的人，内容较长，点点关注收藏不迷路。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.576,
      "audioStart": 35.653,
      "spokenStart": 35.81,
      "spokenEnd": 41.585,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第一步不是增加 Agent，而是判断这个问题有没有值得并行的独立探索路径。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.256,
      "audioStart": 41.609,
      "spokenStart": 41.765,
      "spokenEnd": 46.218,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "研究任务适合并行，因为答案通常来自许多方向。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.984,
      "audioStart": 46.209,
      "spokenStart": 46.378,
      "spokenEnd": 49.553,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "市场、技术、用户和风险可以分别搜索，再由主 Agent 压缩成一个结论。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.64,
      "audioStart": 49.491,
      "spokenStart": 49.653,
      "spokenEnd": 54.487,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "当单个上下文窗口需要同时容纳太多来源、工具结果和中间假设时，子 Agent 还能把各自的搜索压缩成高信号摘要。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.784,
      "audioStart": 54.491,
      "spokenStart": 54.647,
      "spokenEnd": 62.634,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "但如果每一步都依赖上一步的精确状态，拆分会制造大量同步。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.56,
      "audioStart": 62.63,
      "spokenStart": 62.794,
      "spokenEnd": 66.555,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "很多编码任务共享同一份代码和测试状态，往往更适合一个 Agent 连续推进。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.904,
      "audioStart": 66.496,
      "spokenStart": 66.655,
      "spokenEnd": 71.766,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "还要检查经济性。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.848,
      "audioStart": 71.763,
      "spokenStart": 71.926,
      "spokenEnd": 72.988,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Anthropic 的使用数据里，单 Agent 大约消耗普通聊天四倍的 token，多 Agent 大约是十五倍。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.288,
      "audioStart": 72.923,
      "spokenStart": 73.088,
      "spokenEnd": 78.568,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "所以，多 Agent 应该留给价值足够高、错误代价足够大，或者搜索广度会显著改变结果的任务，而不是给简单问题增加仪式感。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.784,
      "audioStart": 78.573,
      "spokenStart": 78.728,
      "spokenEnd": 86.728,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "把判断写成三个门：路径能否独立，单个上下文是否吃紧，结果价值能否覆盖额外成本。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.888,
      "audioStart": 86.72,
      "spokenStart": 86.888,
      "spokenEnd": 92.957,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "三个条件越齐，越值得并行。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.736,
      "audioStart": 92.907,
      "spokenStart": 93.057,
      "spokenEnd": 95.001,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 95.007,
      "spokenStart": 95.161,
      "spokenEnd": 95.833,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，先找能独立推进的路径。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.688,
      "audioStart": 95.779,
      "spokenStart": 95.933,
      "spokenEnd": 97.817,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，共享状态越重，越应该谨慎拆分。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.528,
      "audioStart": 97.82,
      "spokenStart": 97.977,
      "spokenEnd": 100.706,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，高价值结果才配得上更高成本。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.48,
      "audioStart": 100.707,
      "spokenStart": 100.866,
      "spokenEnd": 103.536,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "通过适配门之后，主 Agent 的核心工作不是亲自搜索，而是把问题拆成不会重复也不会漏掉的任务。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 7.344,
      "audioStart": 103.556,
      "spokenStart": 103.716,
      "spokenEnd": 110.239,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "每个委派都要写清目标和预期输出。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.976,
      "audioStart": 110.235,
      "spokenStart": 110.399,
      "spokenEnd": 112.579,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "比如不是研究竞争对手，而是列出三家产品的定价、目标用户和可验证来源。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6,
      "audioStart": 112.512,
      "spokenStart": 112.679,
      "spokenEnd": 117.882,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "接着声明可用工具和来源边界。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.688,
      "audioStart": 117.892,
      "spokenStart": 118.042,
      "spokenEnd": 119.936,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "指定搜索、浏览或数据库，并说明优先使用原始来源，能减少子 Agent 在低质量材料里绕路。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.936,
      "audioStart": 119.873,
      "spokenStart": 120.036,
      "spokenEnd": 126.174,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "还要告诉子 Agent 什么不要做。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.736,
      "audioStart": 126.169,
      "spokenStart": 126.334,
      "spokenEnd": 128.247,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "已经覆盖的地区、时间范围和结论格式都要明确，否则多个 Agent 很容易返回同一批信息。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.576,
      "audioStart": 128.18,
      "spokenStart": 128.347,
      "spokenEnd": 134.112,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Anthropic 把优秀委派总结为目标、输出格式、工具、来源和任务边界。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.496,
      "audioStart": 134.109,
      "spokenStart": 134.272,
      "spokenEnd": 138.962,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "主 Agent 还要根据第一轮发现继续调整分工。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.648,
      "audioStart": 138.898,
      "spokenStart": 139.062,
      "spokenEnd": 141.909,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "先广后窄通常更有效。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.376,
      "audioStart": 141.909,
      "spokenStart": 142.069,
      "spokenEnd": 143.663,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一轮平行扫描线索，第二轮只让 Agent 深挖真正改变判断的分支。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.992,
      "audioStart": 143.603,
      "spokenStart": 143.763,
      "spokenEnd": 147.972,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "最终回收的不只是结论，还要有证据链接、关键不确定项和停止原因。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.496,
      "audioStart": 147.98,
      "spokenStart": 148.132,
      "spokenEnd": 152.838,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "这样主 Agent 才能判断哪些结果可以合并。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.528,
      "audioStart": 152.768,
      "spokenStart": 152.938,
      "spokenEnd": 155.662,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 155.668,
      "spokenStart": 155.822,
      "spokenEnd": 156.499,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，委派必须写清目标和输出。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.904,
      "audioStart": 156.444,
      "spokenStart": 156.599,
      "spokenEnd": 158.705,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，来源、工具和边界要一起交代。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.576,
      "audioStart": 158.71,
      "spokenStart": 158.865,
      "spokenEnd": 161.639,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，回收证据与未知项，不只收结论。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.528,
      "audioStart": 161.641,
      "spokenStart": 161.799,
      "spokenEnd": 164.525,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "多 Agent 不等于越多越好，搜索力度应该跟问题复杂度和预期价值一起变化。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.664,
      "audioStart": 164.54,
      "spokenStart": 164.705,
      "spokenEnd": 169.559,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Anthropic 的经验示例里，简单事实可能只用一个 Agent 和三到十次工具调用。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.736,
      "audioStart": 169.558,
      "spokenStart": 169.719,
      "spokenEnd": 174.661,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "这个量级无需额外协调层。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.52,
      "audioStart": 174.605,
      "spokenStart": 174.761,
      "spokenEnd": 176.473,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "需要对比多个对象时，可以使用两到四个 Agent，每个 Agent 大约十到十五次工具调用，让每条路径都有足够深度。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.04,
      "audioStart": 176.47,
      "spokenStart": 176.633,
      "spokenEnd": 183.86,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "复杂研究可能使用十个以上子 Agent，但这不是默认答案。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.44,
      "audioStart": 183.87,
      "spokenStart": 184.02,
      "spokenEnd": 187.665,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "主 Agent 必须能够看见进度、发现重复，并在边际收益下降时停止。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.28,
      "audioStart": 187.603,
      "spokenStart": 187.765,
      "spokenEnd": 192.231,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "同一个子 Agent 内也可以并行工具调用。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.24,
      "audioStart": 192.234,
      "spokenStart": 192.391,
      "spokenEnd": 194.849,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Anthropic 建议复杂路径常用三到五个子 Agent，并让每个 Agent 同时使用三个以上工具。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.504,
      "audioStart": 194.788,
      "spokenStart": 194.949,
      "spokenEnd": 200.649,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "当路径真的独立时，并行可让复杂查询耗时最多下降百分之九十。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.208,
      "audioStart": 200.649,
      "spokenStart": 200.809,
      "spokenEnd": 205.214,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "这个收益来自等待重叠，而不是让每个 Agent 思考得更聪明。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.92,
      "audioStart": 205.148,
      "spokenStart": 205.314,
      "spokenEnd": 209.429,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "决策树的力度档位可以写成轻量、比较和深挖。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.96,
      "audioStart": 209.432,
      "spokenStart": 209.589,
      "spokenEnd": 212.757,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "每档规定 Agent 数、工具预算、停止条件和升级信号。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.56,
      "audioStart": 212.693,
      "spokenStart": 212.857,
      "spokenEnd": 216.608,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 216.614,
      "spokenStart": 216.768,
      "spokenEnd": 217.454,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，先按复杂度选择力度档位。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.072,
      "audioStart": 217.398,
      "spokenStart": 217.554,
      "spokenEnd": 219.833,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，并行收益来自独立等待的重叠。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.312,
      "audioStart": 219.832,
      "spokenStart": 219.993,
      "spokenEnd": 222.509,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，边际收益下降时就停止扩张。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.36,
      "audioStart": 222.512,
      "spokenStart": 222.669,
      "spokenEnd": 225.243,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "多 Agent 的路径会动态变化，因此评估不能只检查它是否复现了一条固定步骤。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.976,
      "audioStart": 225.257,
      "spokenStart": 225.423,
      "spokenEnd": 230.592,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "先看最终结果：事实是否正确，引用是否支持结论，问题是否覆盖完整，来源是否足够权威。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.608,
      "audioStart": 230.592,
      "spokenStart": 230.752,
      "spokenEnd": 237.564,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "再看过程是否合理：任务拆分有没有重复或空白，工具调用是否有效，主 Agent 是否在新证据出现后调整了计划。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.28,
      "audioStart": 237.572,
      "spokenStart": 237.724,
      "spokenEnd": 245.213,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Anthropic 使用小样本人工评审，并把事实、引用、完整性、来源质量和工具效率放进评估标准。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.656,
      "audioStart": 245.211,
      "spokenStart": 245.373,
      "spokenEnd": 252.21,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "这里的重点是建立可解释的质量信号。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.808,
      "audioStart": 252.148,
      "spokenStart": 252.31,
      "spokenEnd": 254.301,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果只给最终答案打分，系统可能靠高成本碰巧得到好结果；如果只要求固定轨迹，又会惩罚合理的新路径。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.232,
      "audioStart": 254.299,
      "spokenStart": 254.461,
      "spokenEnd": 261.877,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "更稳妥的做法是把结果标准和过程护栏分开。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.912,
      "audioStart": 261.876,
      "spokenStart": 262.037,
      "spokenEnd": 265.148,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "结果必须达标，过程则允许多种路径，但要留下可审查证据。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.848,
      "audioStart": 265.096,
      "spokenStart": 265.248,
      "spokenEnd": 269.308,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "对自己的系统，可以从十个真实问题开始。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.36,
      "audioStart": 269.305,
      "spokenStart": 269.468,
      "spokenEnd": 272.032,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "记录单 Agent 基线、答案质量、token、耗时和失败类型，再决定是否扩大并行。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.216,
      "audioStart": 271.971,
      "spokenStart": 272.132,
      "spokenEnd": 277.552,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 277.558,
      "spokenStart": 277.712,
      "spokenEnd": 278.408,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，先评估事实、引用和覆盖度。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.264,
      "audioStart": 278.348,
      "spokenStart": 278.508,
      "spokenEnd": 280.976,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，允许动态路径，但过程要可解释。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.408,
      "audioStart": 280.972,
      "spokenStart": 281.136,
      "spokenEnd": 283.755,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，用真实基线判断并行是否值得。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.6,
      "audioStart": 283.757,
      "spokenStart": 283.915,
      "spokenEnd": 286.722,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "研究演示能跑通，不代表多 Agent 系统已经能在生产中稳定恢复。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 4.992,
      "audioStart": 286.739,
      "spokenStart": 286.902,
      "spokenEnd": 291.082,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "每个子 Agent 都可能超时、工具报错或返回空结果。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.512,
      "audioStart": 291.078,
      "spokenStart": 291.242,
      "spokenEnd": 294.944,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "主 Agent 需要保存任务状态，让失败只重跑受影响的路径。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.488,
      "audioStart": 294.876,
      "spokenStart": 295.044,
      "spokenEnd": 298.719,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "检查点至少记录任务、负责人、当前状态、证据位置和下一步。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.112,
      "audioStart": 298.727,
      "spokenStart": 298.879,
      "spokenEnd": 303.188,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "这样进程重启后不必从头搜索，也不会把旧结果误当成新结果。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.04,
      "audioStart": 303.131,
      "spokenStart": 303.288,
      "spokenEnd": 307.534,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "可观测性要穿过整个树。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.256,
      "audioStart": 307.533,
      "spokenStart": 307.694,
      "spokenEnd": 309.143,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "为每次委派、工具调用、重试和汇总保留 trace，才能分清是搜索失败、协调失败还是合并失败。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 7.344,
      "audioStart": 309.078,
      "spokenStart": 309.243,
      "spokenEnd": 315.764,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "发布也要渐进。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 315.765,
      "spokenStart": 315.924,
      "spokenEnd": 316.79,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Anthropic 提到彩虹部署，让新旧版本同时运行，避免正在执行的 Agent 因代码切换而中断。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 6.912,
      "audioStart": 316.73,
      "spokenStart": 316.89,
      "spokenEnd": 322.995,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "当前架构还有一个同步瓶颈：主 Agent 等所有子 Agent 返回后再继续。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.328,
      "audioStart": 322.989,
      "spokenStart": 323.155,
      "spokenEnd": 327.673,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "异步能够更快，但会引入优先级、并发和结果合并的新复杂度。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.848,
      "audioStart": 327.616,
      "spokenStart": 327.773,
      "spokenEnd": 331.819,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "因此生产清单是状态持久化、路径级重试、端到端追踪、渐进发布和明确停止规则。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.056,
      "audioStart": 331.816,
      "spokenStart": 331.979,
      "spokenEnd": 338.227,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "速度只是最后的结果，不是唯一目标。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.096,
      "audioStart": 338.172,
      "spokenStart": 338.327,
      "spokenEnd": 340.626,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "本章小节。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 340.632,
      "spokenStart": 340.786,
      "spokenEnd": 341.471,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "第一，把状态和证据写出进程。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.856,
      "audioStart": 341.417,
      "spokenStart": 341.571,
      "spokenEnd": 343.629,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第二，只重试失败路径，并保留完整 trace。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.552,
      "audioStart": 343.623,
      "spokenStart": 343.789,
      "spokenEnd": 346.531,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p10-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p10",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 9,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "第三，用渐进发布和停止规则保护生产。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.888,
      "audioStart": 346.537,
      "spokenStart": 346.691,
      "spokenEnd": 349.786,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "把决策树串起来：先问路径能否独立，再问上下文是否吃紧，然后确认结果价值能覆盖成本。",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 7.152,
      "audioStart": 349.8,
      "spokenStart": 349.966,
      "spokenEnd": 356.3,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c07-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "通过之后，才进入委派、力度、评估和恢复。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.792,
      "audioStart": 356.242,
      "spokenStart": 356.4,
      "spokenEnd": 359.407,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "如果任务共享状态很重，或者一个 Agent 已能稳定完成，就保留单 Agent。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.424,
      "audioStart": 359.41,
      "spokenStart": 359.567,
      "spokenEnd": 364.201,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "多 Agent 是一种任务架构，不是能力勋章。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.288,
      "audioStart": 364.134,
      "spokenStart": 364.301,
      "spokenEnd": 366.779,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "下一次做深度研究时，先画出三条候选路径，并给每条写一行目标、来源、输出和停止条件。",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.416,
      "audioStart": 366.781,
      "spokenStart": 366.939,
      "spokenEnd": 373.558,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "能独立推进，再开并行；不能，就让一个 Agent 继续做完。",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.44,
      "audioStart": 373.496,
      "spokenStart": 373.658,
      "spokenEnd": 377.288,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "关注 Tiny Agent，成为更擅长使用 AI 的人！",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.312,
      "audioStart": 377.28,
      "spokenStart": 377.448,
      "spokenEnd": 379.949,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    }
